  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lord Huang Shi, traveling upstream in the River of Time into a Late Antiquity Era segment thick with sword qi and blade light, recalls Western Desert’s Xi Yuan, who cultivated sword path, created sword abyss, and killed three rank eight Gu Immortals. Remnant immortal killer moves from Xi Yuan’s fight with Dao Jiu Lang can still appear and attack in that blade river segment.",
      "chapters": [
        1432
