    {
      "text": "After nine-nine reincarnation blades leave Lord Huang Shi nearly defenseless, Spectral Soul’s will raises Xi Yuan’s main trump card from the river wave. Deep, powerful sword qi carries unmatchable might. Lord Huang Shi names it Xi Yuan’s signature killer move, sword burial abyss. The sword qi locks him so he cannot budge, then swallows his life force completely and kills the rank eight Heavenly Court time path Gu Immortal.",
